%% TECH-020 Go live with mail
%% The manual steps that turn real sending on, and how each is checked.
flowchart TD
    A[Buy kusinportalen.com at Vercel] --> B[Create the Resend account, add the domain]
    B --> C[DNS records in Vercel: DKIM, send, rsend, DMARC]
    C --> D[RESEND_API_KEY as a secret in Vercel, R2]
    D --> E[Test mail to Gmail and Outlook]
    E --> F{SPF, DKIM, DMARC pass and in the inbox? R1}
    F -- yes --> G[Recorded in verification.md]
    F -- no --> C
